</LDRFIG>
<FL-2>Depreciation of rental property</FL-2>
<LDRFIG>3,000
</LDRFIG>
<FL-2>Trustee's commissions</FL-2>
<LDRFIG>5,000</LDRFIG></LDRWK><PSPACE>(b) The income of the trust for fiduciary accounting purposes is $40,000, computed as follows:
</PSPACE>
